// fleet-lite wire contract.
// Two streams, mirroring what a real fleet needs at minimum:
//   - StreamTelemetry: robot -> server, long-lived client stream (the "heartbeat + sensor" path)
//   - CommandChannel:  bidirectional; the robot announces itself (Hello), the server pushes
//     Commands down, the robot answers with CommandAcks (the "control" path)
// Design note vs MQTT (see README): gRPC gives us a typed schema, per-connection identity,
// and backpressure for free — what daijin had to build by hand on top of MQTT topics.

